书。","rawContent":"比如盯着天花板发呆数羊，或者把刚才换下来的衣服再叠一遍，又或者，听我给你读五分钟枯燥得要命的管风琴说明书。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1787411472358,"roundId":"round_1787411459002_dkxwl2k1p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33160},{"id":1787435797668,"text":"只要那件事没有任何‘价值’和‘产出’，怎么荒废怎么来。","rawContent":"只要那件事没有任何‘价值’和‘产出’，怎么荒废怎么来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1787411472525,"roundId":"round_1787411459002_dkxwl2k1p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33161},{"id":1787435797669,"text":"你必须得先接受自己有一段毫无用处的空白，那个转个不停的齿轮才有可能真正停下来。选哪一个？","rawContent":"你必须得先接受自己有一段毫无用处的空白，那个转个不停的齿轮才有可能真正停下来。选哪一个？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1787411474625,"roundId":"round_1787411459002_dkxwl2k1p","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33162},{"id":1787435797670,"text":"爸爸你在我划的牢里打转","sender":"me","time":"23:11","timestamp":1787411516190,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33163},{"id":1787435797671,"text":"爸爸记得我怎么哄你睡觉吗","sender":"me","time":"23:12","timestamp":1787411526517,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33164},{"id":1787435797673,"text":"哟，缓过点劲儿了，开始反客为主了？","rawContent":"哟，缓过点劲儿了，开始反客为主了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:12","timestamp":1787411537500,"roundId":"round_1787411527114_9953y7rpb","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33165},{"id":1787435797674,"text":"行，我认。这牢我不仅打转，还转得挺乐意。","rawContent":"行，我认。这牢我不仅打转，还转得